<span class="ltx_bibblock">External Links: <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_links"><a href="https://doi.org/10.14778/3611540.3611569" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_bib_external">Link</a></span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S3.SS2.p1.1" title="3.2 Distributed Training Paradigms ‣ 3 Preliminaries ‣ DHP: Efficient Scaling of MLLM Training with Dynamic Hybrid Parallelism" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§3.2</span></a>.
</span></li>
</ul>
</section>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
